---
import { site } from '@/data/site'
---
<div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr]">
  <img src="/profile.jpeg" alt="Patrick Beal" width="112" height="112" class="size-28 rounded-2xl object-cover" />
  <div class="min-w-0 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      I like to work on a problem from the analysis all the way through to software that someone can use, which usually
      means doing the modeling and also building the system that runs it. My background is in optimization, machine
      learning, Bayesian methods, and econometrics, and over the past year I have added AWS, Terraform, and LLM
      applications on top of that.
    </p>
    <p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 text-sm">
      <a class="link" href={site.github}>GitHub</a>
      <a class="link" href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="link" href={site.resume}>Resume (PDF)</a>
      <button type="button" data-action="email" class="link">Copy my email</button>
      <a class="link" href="/about/">More about me →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
